* tests/data/silcs.str
* Example: define LP, LQ in CHARMM style


read rtf card append
* Dummy atom types for SILCS
*
  50  1

MASS -1  LP   0.00000
MASS -1  LQ   0.00000


! RESI DUMM  0.00
! GROUP
!   ATOM LP  LP  0.00
!   ATOM LQ  LQ  0.00
! PATCHING FIRST NONE LAST NONE

END



read para card flex append
* Nonbonded and NBFIX for SILCS dummy
*
NONBONDED nbxmod  5 atom cdiel fshift vatom vdistance vfswitch -
cutnb 14.0 ctofnb 12.0 ctonnb 10.0 eps 1.0 e14fac 1.0 wmin 1.5


LP   0.0   0.0   0.0
LQ   0.0   0.0   0.0

NBFIX
! LP-LP:  (epsilon, Rmin) = (-0.01, 12.0 Å)
LP  LP   -0.01   12.0

! LQ-LQ:  (epsilon, Rmin) = (-0.01, 12.0 Å)
LQ  LQ   -0.01   12.0

END